# Governance Framework
## Digital Mental Health NLP Pipeline for Asian Adolescents

---

## 1. Guiding Principles

| Principle | Description |
|---|---|
| **Do No Harm** | Clinical safety takes absolute priority |
| **Privacy by Design** | Data minimisation built into architecture, not added later |
| **Transparency** | Every risk score is explainable — no black-box decisions |
| **Equity** | Must not systematically disadvantage any demographic group |
| **Accountability** | Clear human responsibility for every automated output |
| **Proportionality** | Minimum data collected and retained |
| **Rectification at Source** | Raw text processed and deleted at point of collection — never stored for later cleaning (Chee, 2026) |

