## 7. Access Control

| Role | Access Level |
|---|---|
| Student (self) | Own risk trend only (optional) |
| School Counsellor | Scores for their school only + feature summary |
| Clinical/REACH Officer | Full output for escalated cases |
| Institution Admin | Aggregate anonymised statistics only |
| Researcher | Fully de-identified data + ethics approval |
| System Admin | Audit logs only — no clinical data |

