## 8. Clinical Accountability

### 8.1 Responsibility Chain

Pipeline Output (automated) → School Counsellor Review (mandatory — human) → Low/Medium: counsellor decides → High: Clinical Officer notified within 2 hours → Crisis imminent: emergency services → Not imminent: care plan developed.

### 8.2 Incident Review

For every missed case or adverse event — review within 14 days covering what the pipeline flagged, what clinical action was taken, contributing factors, and changes required.

